# iCEbreaker pin constraints for the button-reset Blinky variant
# (Lattice iCE40 UP5K, sg48 package).
#
# Same as icebreaker.pcf but adds the on-board user button so the two designs
# don't share one bare pcf: BlinkyWithReset.topEntity has an extra `btn` port,
# and nextpnr errors on a pcf whose ports don't match the design.
#
# Port names must match the `topEntity` named ports in src/BlinkyWithReset.hs
# (`clk`, `rst`, `led`).

# 12 MHz oscillator
set_io clk 35
set_frequency clk 12

# Green user LED
set_io led 11

# On-board user button (BTN_N, active-low) -> reset
set_io rst 10
